{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_017jJHasDc2Mr1pqmejNSTeR", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Palazzo_della_Cancelleria\"}, {\"url\": \"https://classicistranieri.com/en/p/a/l/Palazzo_della_Cancelleria_47f9.html\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.advocacy.com.au/scottsitaly2018/3.-cancelleria.html\"}, {\"url\": \"https://curate.nd.edu/show/d791sf2909p\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.pilotguides.com/articles/the-grand-papal-palaces-of-rome/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://opendcl.elevator.umn.edu/asset/viewAsset/5d7bd8e13f3cb171e26f0c54\"}, {\"url\": \"https://aureliagarden.it/en/arte-storia/monumenti-di-roma-palazzo-venezia\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.pilotguides.com/?p=13952\"}, {\"url\": \"https://curate.nd.edu/articles/figure/Palazzo_della_Cancelleria_Raking_view_of_the_front_facade_facing_the_Piazza/24743871\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.ancient-history-sites.com/sites/palazzo-farnese-2/\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T12:29:09.500Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "first palace in Rome erected from the ground in the new Renaissance style", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_013svsbH9VVkW3pUFZLCR3Wx", "content": [{"title": "Palazzo della Cancelleria", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Palazzo_della_Cancelleria"}, {"title": "Web Analytics", "url": "https://classicistranieri.com/en/p/a/l/Palazzo_della_Cancelleria_47f9.html"}, {"title": "t Return to Main Page ROME", "url": "https://www.advocacy.com.au/scottsitaly2018/3.-cancelleria.html"}, {"title": "University of Notre Dame", "url": "https://curate.nd.edu/show/d791sf2909p"}, {"title": "the grand papal palaces of rome", "url": "https://www.pilotguides.com/articles/the-grand-papal-palaces-of-rome/"}, {"title": "University of Minnesota", "url": "https://opendcl.elevator.umn.edu/asset/viewAsset/5d7bd8e13f3cb171e26f0c54"}, {"title": "monumenti di roma palazzo venezia", "url": "https://aureliagarden.it/en/arte-storia/monumenti-di-roma-palazzo-venezia"}, {"title": "www.pilotguides.com", "url": "https://www.pilotguides.com/?p=13952"}, {"title": "University of Notre Dame", "url": "https://curate.nd.edu/articles/figure/Palazzo_della_Cancelleria_Raking_view_of_the_front_facade_facing_the_Piazza/24743871"}, {"title": "Palazzo Farnese: Renaissance palace and dynastic seat in Rome", "url": "https://www.ancient-history-sites.com/sites/palazzo-farnese-2/"}]}, "The answer is most likely the **Palazzo della Cancelleria**, though one source names a different building.\n\n- **Cancelleria:** Wikipedia's entry describes it as the first palazzo in Rome built from the ground up in the new Renaissance style (index 1-2). It was built between 1489 and 1513 (index 2-5). Donato Bramante is credited as designer, though one source notes that documentation doesn't identify its architects (index 9-4). It was commissioned for Cardinal Raffaele Riario (index 3-3).\n- **Conflicting claim:** Some sources credit Palazzo Venezia as the first Renaissance palace in Rome, saying it was built in 1455 for Cardinal Pietro Barbo, the future Pope Paul II (index 7-2). Its design is attributed to Leon Battista Alberti (index 7-3). The Cancelleria's dates place it later, so the two accounts differ on which came first.\n- **Other candidate:** Palazzo Farnese was begun around 1514 (index 10-1), so it postdates the Cancelleria.\n\nOverall, the Cancelleria is the best-supported answer to your question, but the Palazzo Venezia claim is worth noting if you need a definitive source."], "durationSeconds": 6.405319209, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_017jJHasDc2Mr1pqmejNSTeR", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgDVNyHpnGibtXMwvxh2r", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "**答案：文书院宫（Palazzo della Cancelleria）**\n\n我只搜了 1 次（上限是 5 次）。维基百科说，它是罗马第一座从地基开始按新的文艺复兴风格建造的宫殿。它在 1489–1513 年间为红衣主教拉法埃莱·里亚里奥（Raffaele Riario）建造，一般认为设计者是布拉曼特（Bramante）。题目原句“erected from the ground in the new Renaissance style”出自维基百科。\n\n另有说法：也有资料说威尼斯宫（Palazzo Venezia）是罗马第一座文艺复兴宫殿，它从 1455 年开始建造，比文书院宫早。但“从地基开始建造”这个说法对应的是文书院宫。\n\n依据：\n- [Palazzo della Cancelleria – Wikipedia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Palazzo_della_Cancelleria)\n- [Palazzo della Cancelleria – classicistranieri.com（维基百科镜像）](https://classicistranieri.com/en/p/a/l/Palazzo_della_Cancelleria_47f9.html)\n- [Palazzo Venezia – aureliagarden.it（另一种说法）](https://aureliagarden.it/en/arte-storia/monumenti-di-roma-palazzo-venezia)"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1245, "cache_read_input_tokens": 4290, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 1245}, "output_tokens": 467, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T12:29:14.986Z", "request_id": "req_011CgDVNy2hcQDRdA6dMHEpG"}
